"db11_table": "<table class='t'><tr><th>deal (P1,P2,P3)</th><th>P2 bets</th><th>P2 checks</th><th>what happens after the bet (family values)</th></tr><tr><td>(2, 1, 3)</td><td>\\(2\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 folds, P1 folds the 2 (\\(a_{23}=0\\)): P2 takes the pot</td></tr><tr><td>(2, 1, 4)</td><td>\\(-2\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 calls (\\(c_{42}=1\\)), P1 folds (\\(a_{24}=0\\)), P3's 4 wins</td></tr><tr><td>(3, 1, 2)</td><td>\\(2 - 4 a_{33}\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 folds; P1 calls with prob. \\(a_{33}\\) (P2 gets \\(-2\\)), else folds (P2 gets \\(+2\\))</td></tr><tr><td>(3, 1, 4)</td><td>\\(-2\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 calls (\\(c_{42}=1\\)), P1 folds (\\(a_{34}=0\\)), P3's 4 wins</td></tr><tr><td>(4, 1, 2)</td><td>\\(-2\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 folds, P1 calls with the 4 (\\(a_{43}=1\\))</td></tr><tr><td>(4, 1, 3)</td><td>\\(-2\\)</td><td>\\(-1\\)</td><td>P3 folds, P1 calls with the 4 (\\(a_{43}=1\\))</td></tr></table>",
"db11_result": "\\[\\begin{aligned}D_{b_{11}}\\big|_{\\text{family}}&=\\tfrac1{24}\\big[(2+1)+(-2+1)+(2-4a_{33}+1)+3\\cdot(-2+1)\\big]\\&=\\tfrac{2-4a_{33}}{24}=- \\frac{2 a_{33} - 1}{12}\\end{aligned}\\]",
"family_table": "<table class='t'><tr><th>coordinate</th><th>decision</th><th>\\(D\\) on the family (Tables 2, 3 pins)</th><th>what it says</th></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{33}}\\)</td><td>P1 calls with the 3 after K B F</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 b_{11} + 2 b_{21} - b_{41})\\)</td><td>\\(a_{33}\\) interior \\(\\Rightarrow\\) \\(b_{41}=2(b_{11}+b_{21})\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{11}}\\)</td><td>P2 bluffs the 1 after K</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 a_{33} - 1)\\)</td><td>\\(b_{11}\\) interior \\(\\Rightarrow\\) \\(a_{33}=\\tfrac12\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{21}}\\)</td><td>P2 bluffs the 2 after K</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 a_{33} + 2 b_{23} c_{11} - b_{23} - 1)\\)</td><td>with \\(a_{33}=\\tfrac12\\): \\(-b_{23}(2c_{11}-1)/12\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{23}}\\)</td><td>P2 calls with the 2 after K K B F</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 c_{11} - 1)\\)</td><td>\\(b_{23}>0\\Rightarrow c_{11}=\\tfrac12\\) (sub-family C only)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{33}}\\)</td><td>P2 calls with the 3 after K K B F</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 c_{11} + 2 c_{21} - 1)\\)</td><td>\\(b_{33}\\) interior \\(\\Rightarrow c_{11}+c_{21}=\\tfrac12\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{41}}\\)</td><td>P2 bets the 4 after K</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(a_{33} - c_{11} - c_{21})\\)</td><td>consistent with \\(a_{33}=\\tfrac12=c_{11}+c_{21}\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{c_{11}}\\)</td><td>P3 bluffs the 1 after K K</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 b_{21} b_{23} - b_{21} - 2 b_{23} - 2 b_{33} + b_{41} + 1)\\)</td><td>\\(c_{11}\\) interior \\(\\Rightarrow\\) \\(b_{33}=\\tfrac12+\\tfrac{b_{41}-b_{21}}2-b_{23}(1-b_{21})\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{c_{21}}\\)</td><td>P3 bluffs the 2 after K K</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(b_{11} + 2 b_{33} - b_{41} - 1)\\)</td><td>\\(c_{21}\\) interior \\(\\Rightarrow\\) \\(b_{33}=\\tfrac{1+b_{41}-b_{11}}2\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{11}}\\)</td><td>P1 bets the 1 (deterrence)</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 b_{32} + 2 c_{33} - 1)\\)</td><td>\\(\\le0\\iff c_{33}\\ge \\tfrac12-b_{32}=:\\mathrm{lo}\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{21}}\\)</td><td>P1 bets the 2 (deterrence)</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{12}\\,(2 b_{32} + 2 c_{33} - 1)\\)</td><td>identical to \\(a_{11}\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{41}}\\)</td><td>P1 bets the 4 (deterrence)</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(b_{11} c_{21} - 2 b_{11} + b_{21} c_{11} - 2 b_{21} + 2 b_{32} - 2 c_{11} - 2 c_{21} + 2 c_{33})\\)</td><td>\\(\\le 0\\iff c_{33}\\le \\mathrm{hi}\\) (see Ch. 6)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{31}}\\)</td><td>P1 bets the 3 (deterrence)</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(4 a_{33} b_{11} + 4 a_{33} b_{21} - 2 a_{33} b_{41} + 3 b_{11} c_{21} - 3 b_{11} + 3 b_{21} c_{11} - 3 b_{21} - 3 c_{11} - 3 c_{21} + 4)\\)</td><td>strictly negative: the costliest opening</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{22}}\\)</td><td>P1 calls with the 2 after K K B</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(b_{11} + b_{41} c_{11} + 3 c_{11} - 2)\\)</td><td>\\(\\le0\\iff c_{11}\\le\\frac{2-b_{11}}{3+b_{41}}\\) (Table 3's cap on \\(c_{11}\\))</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{a_{32}}\\)</td><td>P1 calls with the 3 after K K B</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(4 b_{11} c_{21} - b_{11} + 4 b_{21} c_{11} - b_{21} - b_{41} c_{11} - b_{41} c_{21} - 3 c_{11} - 3 c_{21} + 2)\\)</td><td>\\(\\le 0\\) on the family (a round-2 deterrence)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{31}}\\)</td><td>P2 bluffs the 3 after K</td><td>\\(-\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(4 b_{33} c_{11} + 4 b_{33} c_{21} - 2 b_{33} - 3 c_{11} - 3 c_{21} + 4)\\)</td><td>with \\(c_{11}+c_{21}=\\tfrac12\\): exactly \\(-\\tfrac5{48}\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{c_{31}}\\)</td><td>P3 bets the 3 after K K</td><td>\\(\\tfrac{1}{24}\\,(b_{11} - b_{21} b_{23} + b_{21} + b_{23} + 2 b_{41} - 4)\\)</td><td>strictly negative on the family</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{b_{32}}\\)</td><td>P2 calls P1's bet with the 3</td><td>\\(0\\)</td><td>\\(0\\): unreached (P1 never bets)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{c_{33}}\\)</td><td>P3 calls with the 3 after B F</td><td>\\(0\\)</td><td>\\(0\\): unreached</td></tr><tr><td>\\(D_{c_{34}}\\)</td><td>P3 calls with the 3 after B C</td>